    "solutions": [
      {
        "title": "Area two ways",
        "body": "The hypotenuse is 10 and one leg is 6, so the other leg is $\\sqrt{10^2-6^2}=8$. The area is $\\frac12\\cdot6\\cdot8=24$, and also $\\frac12\\cdot10\\cdot h$. So $5h=24$ and $h=\\frac{24}5$.\n\n**Answer: (A) $\\frac{24}5$**"
