    "prompt": "$ABD$ is a triangle with points $C$ and $E$ on its sides so that $CB=AB=AC=CE=ED$. The size of $\\angle D$ is:",
    "image": "qimages/samf/junior-2009-r1/q16.webp",
    "choices": [
      {
        "key": "A",
        "text": "$15^\\circ$"
      },
