        "title": "Straight parts and corners",
        "body": "The path has four straight strips of $80\\times2=160$ m$^2$ each, total $640$. At the corners the rounded parts together make up one full circle of radius 2 (the total turning is $360^\\circ$), with area $\\pi\\cdot2^2=4\\pi$.\n\nArea $=640+4\\pi$.\n\n**Answer: (D) $640+4\\pi$**"
