    "solutions": [
      {
        "title": "Count numbers up to a row",
        "body": "Row $k$ has $k$ numbers, so rows 1 to $n$ hold $\\frac{n(n+1)}2$ numbers. For $n=62$ that is $1953$ and for $n=63$ it is $2016$. Since $1953<2009\\le2016$, the 2009th number is in row 63.\n\n**Answer: (D) Row 63**"
